00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:06,500
Peace Dividend Your government spends more on camouflage paint than on curing Alzheimer's.

2
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:14,700
Move one percent of the bomb budget to medicine: twenty-seven point two billion dollars for clinical trials, plus one hundred

3
