142
00:16:15,900 --> 00:16:19,440
The treaty passes and bondholders start lobbying for two percent.

143
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:27,660
In years four through seven, at two percent, research funding is fifty-four point four billion dollars per year and war

144
00:16:27,660 --> 00:16:31,900
costs saved are two hundred and twenty-seven billion dollars per year.

145
00:16:32,580 --> 00:16:40,280
Politicians discover voters like living. In years eight through twelve, at five percent, research funding is one hundred

146
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:47,220
and thirty-six billion dollars per year and war costs saved are five hundred and sixty-eight billion dollars per year.

147
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:55,980
The health lobby rivals the defense lobby. In years thirteen through twenty, at ten percent, research funding is two hundred

148
00:16:55,980 --> 00:17:03,300
and seventy-two billion dollars per year and war costs saved are one point one four trillion dollars per year.

149
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:12,980
Defense contractors pivot to health. Over twenty years, the trajectory change is worth sixteen point three trillion dollars:

150
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:21,020
three point one six trillion dollars redirected to curing diseases, plus one point zero due to terrorism feedback loops.

151
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:29,920
That is thirteen point two trillion dollars your species no longer spends on the industry of blowing things up and rebuilding

152
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:37,260
them. That's at e equals one point zero (one percent spending cut equals one percent war cost reduction).

153
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:45,860
Given that military spending generates the terrorism it's built to fight, the actual elasticity is probably better, which

154
00:17:45,860 --> 00:17:52,280
means these numbers are conservative. Moronia's politicians were rewarded for buying weapons.

155
00:17:52,380 --> 00:17:57,520
Moronia's contractors were rewarded for selling weapons. Moronia's A.I.

156
00:17:57,540 --> 00:18:03,760
read the receipts and optimized accordingly. Every budget vote was an instruction, and the A.I.

157
00:18:03,900 --> 00:18:12,180
was a very good student. The I.A.B. ratchet flips the incentive structure using the same force that currently points it

158
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:21,180
toward explosions: money. The difference between Moronia and the civilization that survived wasn't intelligence, resources,

159
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:28,260
or goodwill. It was whether the richest people on the planet made more money from expanding the treaty or from letting it

160
00:18:28,260 --> 00:18:37,380
